e non-refundable. In the event of a rescheduled game, original tickets may be used to attend the new date<br>\n* No Re-Entry<br>\n* Subject to Bag Searches Upon Entry<br></i>\n<br>\n<strong>About the Bearcats</strong><br>\nThe <strong>Truro Bearcats</strong> are a Junior 'A' hockey team based in Truro, Nova Scotia, and one of six Nova Scotia teams competing in the <strong>Maritime Junior Hockey League (MHL)</strong>.<br><br>\nFormed in 1997 as a member of the Maritime Junior A Hockey League, the Bearcats have built a proud tradition of competitive hockey in Truro, highlighted most recently by their <strong>2025-26 Metalfab MHL Cup Championship</strong>.<br><br>\nThe Bearcats play their home games at the <strong>Rath Eastlink Community Centre</strong>, bringing exciting junior hockey and an entertaining game-night experience to the community throughout the season.\n\n"
