      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "OZZY - BLACK SABBATH - Back To The Beginning"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>SUPERNAUT</b>'s new show for 2026 is an homage to OZZY and Black Sabbath's final show: Back to the Beginning. That 2025 performance in the band's home town of Birmingham UK featured a set of classic Ozzy Osbourne solo material and a separate set of Black Sabbath classics. This new show will feature the same as well as an all new stage show with dazzling pyrotechnics and stunning visuals.</p> \n\n<b>SUPERNAUT</b> is a Black Sabbath/OZZY tribute band from Summerside P.E.I. with Scott Cleary on vocals, Aron Scott on guitar, Stéphane Bouchard on bass and Yves Arsenault on drums. Scott is an OZZY OSBOURNE impersonator who has been performing BLACK SABBATH and OZZY solo material based out of Toronto then the Maritimes since the 1990's. Aron, Stéphane, and Yves are talented instrumentalists with decades of experience playing in a multitude of bands and musical projects over the years and are some of the most respected and sought after musicians on Prince Edward Island. The band is committed to an exact recreation of the music of BLACK SABBATH and OZZY OSBOURNE. The high energy SUPERNAUT show is an entertaining trip back to the 1970's and 80's.</p> \n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
