    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1700388335/performances/MCC05JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "TIFF Film Circuit: At the Place of Ghosts"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>The Colchester Film Society is thrilled to continue our TIFF: Film Circuit screenings at The Marigold Cultural Centre with an unforgettable, visceral supernatural thriller: Bretten Hannam's deeply personal and chilling film, Sk+te'kmujue'katik (At The Place of Ghosts)!</p><br>\n\n<p>Eleven years in the writing, the story follows siblings Mise'l and Antle, close confidants in childhood who have drifted apart as adults. When a malevolent spirit begins tormenting them, the siblings are forced to reunite and journey into Sk+te'kmujue'katik, a primordial forest that exists outside of time, to confront the violence of their shared upbringing.</p><br>\n\n<p>Crafted by Two-Spirit, L'nu filmmaker Bretten Hannam from Kespukwitk, L'nuekati (Nova Scotia), the film masterfully weaves themes of community, culture, language, and Two-Spirit identity into a thrilling cinematic experience.</p><br>\n\n<p>Join us on October 5, 2026, at the Marigold Cultural Centre! Doors open at 6:30 PM and the show starts at 7:00 PM. Grab your popcorn, if you dare, for another powerful night of movie magic.</p>\n\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
