    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Care for All - North American Premiere - Presented by Contemporancient Theatre in association with the Liverpool International Theatre Festival (LITF)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Experience the North American premiere of Care for All, an acclaimed new Welsh musical that tells the inspiring story of the people who believed healthcare should be available to everyone.</p>\n<p>Featuring powerful original music and compelling storytelling, Care for All explores themes of compassion, community, sacrifice, and hope that continue to resonate today.</p>\n<p>Presented by Contemporancient Theatre in association with the Liverpool International Theatre Festival (LITF), this special production is led by LITF Co-Artistic Directors Neil Maidman and Vic Mills and offers audiences a unique opportunity to experience their work just days before the 17th Biennial Liverpool International Theatre Festival begins.</p>\n<p>Join us for this one-night-only performance and help support two of Liverpool's cultural treasures. Proceeds from ticket sales will be shared by the Astor Theatre and the Liverpool International Theatre Festival.</p>\n\n<style>\n\n@media screen and (max-width:728px) {\niframe{width:100%!important;}\n}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
