    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Islander Show-Down"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>COME JOIN THE FUN!</b></p><br>\n\n<p>Come and join the fun, excitement, and mayhem of being part of the studio audience for a truly unique television event!</p><br>\n\n<p>Islander Show-Down is a show within a show; a new Canadian sitcom that takes place backstage at a hilarious parody game show. On camera, Canadian actor Peter Keleghan plays the larger-than-life host of a game show where two real Islander teams compete head-to-head for a chance to win money for a local charity.</p><br>\n\n<p>But behind the scenes, the real comedy begins!</p><br>\n\n<p>We need a big, loud, rambunctious studio audience to bring the energy, enthusiasm, and laughter that will make the show come alive. You'll cheer, react, laugh, and play a part in the action as the cameras roll. Expect fun, laughter, stiff competition, and plenty of surprises. And bring your biggest smile, because once you purchase a ticket, you may just see yourself on TV next year!</p><br>\n\n<p>Come be part of the audience. Come be part of the show. Come be part of Islander Show-Down!</p><br>\n\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
