    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Festival Pass - Antigonish Jazz Fest - November 5-7, 2026"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\n<p>Celebrate 5 Years of the Antigonish Jazz Festival!<br><br>\n\nThe Antigonish Jazz Festival returns for its 5th year, bringing three days of live jazz to Antigonish, Nova Scotia. From November 5-7, enjoy an exciting lineup of performances in some of Antigonish's favourite local venues, from intimate restaurants and breweries to larger stages.<br><br>\n\nOver the past five years, the festival has grown into a much-loved celebration of music, culture and community. What makes Antigonish Jazz special is its up-close and intimate atmosphere, where audiences and musicians come together to experience live music in a way that feels personal and connected.<br><br>\n\nJoin us as we celebrate five years of jazz in Antigonish — and be part of the next chapter!</p>"
      }
    ],
