    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Pictou County Pop Classics Presents: After the Harvest Moon - A Neil Young Tribute"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p> 2026 marks the 25th Anniversary for Glasgow Square, and 10 years since the first 'Pictou County Pop Classic' show filled the theatre with an enthusiastic local audience. From a 70's show, to a 60's show, a 'Quad Tribute' and a full 'Neil Young Tribute', you bought every ticket for every show, at every venue, showing your unwavering support for your local cover artist playing these 'Pop Classics Tunes'!</p>\nSo, we've decided to take our 'Neil Young Tribute' off the shelf and run it for you again, on the full moon...</p>\n<p>'After The Harvest Moon' 2026.</p>\n<p>With very little change in the cast and setlist, we will deliver more than 20 of your Neil Young Classic Favorites covered closely to their original versions! </p>\n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n\n"
      }
    ],
