    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Winter Shine Series - Tragic Little Pill: Alanis Morissette Tribute  - Featuring Soul Filter"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Soul Filter, a dynamic 4-piece Alt Rock-Pop band from Summerside, performs new music\nfrom their upcoming album. Known for their windows-down, 90s-inspired sound and\nconfessional lyrics, the award-nominated band blends introspective themes with catchy,\nanthemic melodies, soulful vocals, pop hooks and gritty guitar. Singer-songwriter Karen\nPenton writes with the intention of finding the silver linings and life lessons in both love and\nmisery, while taking inspiration from artists like Alanis Morissette, The Cranberries and\nSheryl Crow. Members are: Karen Penton - lead vocals & acoustic rhythm guitar, Mike\nPenton - electric lead guitar, Ronnie Arsenault - bass Guitar, and Andy Adams on drums.\nThe band will be joined by Sarah Cameron on keyboard and backup vocals.</p> \n<p>Tragic Little Pill plays tribute to the music of Alanis Morissette, a Canadian-born\ninternational icon who became a cultural phenomenon in the 90s with hits like 'You Oughta\nKnow,' 'Ironic,' and 'Thank You.' Performing classics from 'Jagged Little Pill' - one of the\ntop-selling albums of all time - and more, you'll be singing along to every word. The tribute\nband includes members of Soul Filter with the addition of Sarah Cameron on keyboards\nand background vocals.</p> \n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
