    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Canada's treasures, The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan Tour make their highly anticipated first trip ever to Prince Edward Island!</p><br>\n\n<p>Performing at the Florence Simmons Performance Hall on <b>Friday April 9, 2027</b> and led by Maritime comedy star, <b>Travis Lindsay</b>, this show will leave you wanting more.</p><br>\n\n<p>Travis is a writer and on-air correspondent with <b>This Hour Has 22 Minutes</b> and a <b>Canada's Got Talent Finalist</b>, multiple appearances at Just For Laughs, Halifax Comedy Fest, and New Wave of Stand Up on CBC GEM, Hubcap Comedy Fest. He's even met Rosa Parks!</p><br>\n\n<p><b>Travis will be joined by:</b><br>\n<b>Feature Act:</b> Todd Reid (Just For Laughs, SiriusXM and Page International Screenwriting Contest Quarterfinalist)<br>\n<b>Host:</b> Matt Watson (Just For Laughs, SiriusXM, Glasgow Comedy Festival and Melbourne Comedy Festival)</p><br>\n\n<p>The best part of all, this is a benefit show for Make A Wish Canada-PEI!!</p><br>\n\n<p>Get your tickets before they're gone!</p><br>\n\n"
      }
    ],
